    // Wolfenstein wears his character's sheet (`wolfenstein`), every row in
    // PNG order: idle->Rest, walk and run->DashEcho, jump/fall/land_hard->Rest,
    // hit->Hit, death->Death, taunt (the howl)->SpikeHalo, slash (the claw
    // sweep), attack_side (the bite) and attack_up->SideSweep, attack_down
    // (the two-fist hammer)->FloorSlam. A boss anim plays the FIRST row that
    // names it.
    //
    // The sheet publishes his body box, so the body box places him and the
    // frame's centre is the centre of his body: the 320 px frame has his body
    // (159 px, feet at y 240) in its middle, with empty space under the feet.
    // The frame is drawn `collision_scale` x the body box's height: 320/159
    // makes the 159 px body the 100 units of his body box.
    // `feet_anchor_y` is the frame's own foot, for a draw with no body box.
    "wolfenstein_boss": (
        label_width: 100,
        frame_width: 320,
        frame_height: 320,
        rows: [
            (Rest, (
                frame_count: 8,
                duration_secs: 0.16,
